@page "/terms"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" GutterBottom="true">Terms of Service</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-4"><em>Care Coordination</em> is a private, invite-only app used by one family's caregiving team. It is provided by that team's administrator for the sole use of people they've personally invited.</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">Acceptable use</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    Use this app only to help coordinate care for the patient your care team supports. Keep your
    login credentials confidential, and don't share access with anyone who hasn't been invited by
    the administrator.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">SMS notifications</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    If you choose to provide a phone number, you'll receive SMS notifications about your caregiving
    shifts (assignments, replacement requests, document uploads). This is optional; message
    frequency varies with your care team's shift activity, and message and data rates may apply. You
    can stop these messages at any time by removing your phone number in account settings or by
    replying STOP. Reply HELP for help. See the <MudLink Href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</MudLink> for
    how your information is used.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">No warranty</MudText>
<MudText Class="mb-4">
    This app is provided "as is," with no warranty of any kind, by an individual self-hosting it for
    their own family's use rather than as a commercial service.
</MudText>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mt-4 mb-1">Access</MudText>
<MudText>
    Your administrator may revoke your access to this app at any time.
</MudText>
